  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6341.16 Billing Record Retention. Providers shall retain records for a period of not less than 7 years after the completion date of services provided, supporting each bill submitted to the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6341) #9392, eff 3-1-09, EXPIRED: 3-1-17\n\nNew. #12535, INTERIM, eff 5-24-18, EXPIRED: 11-20-18\n\nNew. #12684, eff 11-30-18 (formerly He-C 6341.14)",
